### wallet import without a file
$ devnet-dvpn wallet import
wallet import <keyfile.json | -> (- reads stdin)
(exit 3)

### wallet show with no wallet
$ devnet-dvpn wallet show
No wallet. Use: wallet create | wallet import <file>
(exit 0)

### wallet create (libsecret keyring)
$ devnet-dvpn wallet create --yes
Created CcEKr2cyA9GwUhrsBmUrFqCCsxeTQdmP3fyv4tryaR3G
Write these 24 words down. They are shown once:
<24 words redacted>
(exit 0)

### wallet secret is in the keyring, not on disk
$ bash -c secret-tool search --all application devnet-dvpn 2>&1 | grep -q 'data-dir' && [ -f '/home/ubuntu/ddv-sweep-local/wallet.cli.keyring' ] && ! grep -rqs '"secretKey"' '/home/ubuntu/ddv-sweep-local'

(exit 0)

