### settings get
$ devnet-dvpn settings get
rpcUrls            ["https://api.devnet.solana.com"]
defaultBasis       "per_gb"
defaultGb          1
defaultHours       1
preferredCountry   null
autoConnect        false
autoTopUpDevice    true
startWithOs        false
closeToTray        true
thirdPartyChecks   true
notifications      true
theme              "system"
language           "en"
favourites         []
allowanceTdvpn     "50"
poll               {"wallet":60,"nodes":300,"plans":600,"subscriptions":600,"settlements":60,"ip":30,"dns":15,"rpc":60,"session":5}
(exit 0)

### settings set (allow-listed key)
$ devnet-dvpn settings set defaultBasis=per_hour
defaultBasis = "per_hour"
(exit 0)

### settings set rejects unknown keys
$ devnet-dvpn settings set bogus=1
unknown setting "bogus". Known: rpcUrls, defaultBasis, defaultGb, defaultHours, preferredCountry, autoConnect, autoTopUpDevice, startWithOs, closeToTray, thirdPartyChecks, notifications, theme, language, favourites, allowanceTdvpn, poll
(exit 3)

### settings set rejects a bad value
$ devnet-dvpn settings set defaultGb=3
Error: Invalid value for defaultGb (left unchanged)
(exit 1)

### rpc state
$ devnet-dvpn rpc state
Serving https://api.devnet.solana.com/  slot 513496711  222 ms
Warning: only the public devnet RPC is configured; it rate-limits real use.
(exit 0)

### rpc set rejects plain http
$ devnet-dvpn rpc set http://example.com
Error: Not accepted (https only; http only for 127.0.0.1): http://example.com
(exit 1)

### rpc set (public devnet)
$ devnet-dvpn rpc set https://api.devnet.solana.com
RPC pool: https://api.devnet.solana.com
(exit 0)

